From a8b53dca57e0138fed9bd0393786342816a1498d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:00:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): portable in-app Ollama bootstrap

Download the official zip/tgz into the SmartCaja data dir when Ollama is
missing, extract, start serve, and pull models on the splash without
restarting. Reuse a healthy system Ollama on :11434 and only kill the
PID this app started.
